{"title":"2007 IMO Shortlist Problems/A2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/A2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(<i>Bulgaria</i>)\nConsider those functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/a/59a5f7d3075af89ec1d3f6cbdada5588ca99d403.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:\\mathbb{N}\\to\\mathbb{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" /> which satisfy the condition\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/c/daceeebdfbd55bb788e57a9592376ce8ebfa22f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(m+n)\\ge f(m)+f(f(n))-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"256\" height=\"20\" /></center>\n<p>for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/6/1567b4cdaa6278deb782d16ad6ca096a9e75b260.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m, n\\in\\mathbb{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"18\" />. Find all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/b/9ab062b9e1272c6e6ff377f3c7235eb0b701c8fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2007).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/e/a1e6cd0e4103015efba12e0fc4291f012b467eaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> denotes the set of all integers.)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/A2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<!--